  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for OpenTelemetry distributed-tracing (System.Diagnostics.Activity) assertions in .NET test projects. Captures Activity spans from one or more ActivitySources through a raw ActivityListener into a disposable, per-test SpanCapture, with query helpers that find spans by operation name and tag and navigate parent/child relationships, and a renderer that prints the captured spans as a tree. Test-framework assertion entry points live in adapter packages (TracingAssertions.TUnit). AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection, and no NuGet runtime dependency (System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource is in the shared framework).",
  "id": "TracingAssertions",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T17:50:56.743Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "JNl/TvsZ3+fhFxvx4LzGBcywOjdr7Rt+ekirN3YdRvU9Y3w+URabbaxTQmk1ks9nbt0ckanNtwIjh0PpjvDD1Q==",
